#. ~ Description of profession "Naked Wanderer" for male
#: e:\Cataclysm-Medieval\data\mods\Medieval\10_medieval_core\professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You have nothing.  No skills, no tools, no weapons — not even the faintest memory of how you got here.  In this harsh medieval wilderness, your bare hands and wits are all you possess."
msgstr ""

